  m_Name: HungryDarkBreach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::WardBreachDefinition
  displayName: The Hungry Dark
  warningText: The portal shudders. They have learned where the warmth is, and they are coming for more than you. Mend what you can and set your traps; the marked roads show where they will walk.
  pendingText: They are gathering beyond the ward. When you are ready, I will open it and we will meet them here.
  startHint: Wolves and rootlings will come
  wonText: The last of them falls. The ward knits itself closed, and the home stands.
  failedText: The ward tears. They scatter with what they came for, and the light gutters. Rest, and meet them again.
